            "title": "ProQR Therapeutics assumed with an Overweight at Cantor Fitzgerald",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Cantor Fitzgerald analyst Steve Seedhouse assumed coverage of ProQR Therapeutics (PRQR) with an Overweight rating and $8 price target ProQR is a leader in RNA editing and the initial biomarker data for its first program targeting bile acid transporter in Q4 will be an \u201cimportant catalyst,\u201d the analyst tells investors in a research note. Cantor views the company as a \u201cpure play\u201d on RNA editing. Published first on TheFly \u2013 the ultimate source for real-time, market-moving breaking financial news. T",
